!! Current Status

By ((Robin Powell|my)) count, we have checkpointed 314 words; the ((ma'oste)) has 1091 lines, so that puts us at 29% completed.  Note that words are counted by searching the ma'oste for the selma'o, to deal with different choices in compouding between the BPFK and the ma'oste.

It should be noted, however, that we've already done most of the controversial and hard stuff, and that there are many words in the ma'oste we have no intention of doing (PA* and LE* come to mind).
